#: ../NEWS:33163
msgid ""
":issue:`43794`: Add :const:`ssl.OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF` constants (OpenSSL "
"3.0.0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:33166
msgid ""
":issue:`43785`: Improve ``bz2.BZ2File`` performance by removing the RLock "
"from BZ2File. This makes BZ2File thread unsafe in the face of multiple "
"simultaneous readers or writers, just like its equivalent classes in :mod:"
"`gzip` and :mod:`lzma` have always been.  Patch by Inada Naoki."
