msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:33605
msgid ""
":issue:`35883`: Python no longer fails at startup with a fatal error if a "
"command line argument contains an invalid Unicode character. The :c:func:"
"`Py_DecodeLocale` function now escapes byte sequences which would be decoded "
